{
  "method": "curated",
  "scope": "selected_capability",
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "config",
      "owner": "transfer",
      "kind": "normative",
      "path": "transfer/docs/transfer-基本概念及配置说明.md",
      "anchor": "## 一、核心对象",
      "commit": "a049fc71dd51118f44f53306cea066f0ae3bad97",
      "sha256": "9902b45401f85c0ff0509b5307cf127aad0bb4af987f13c262828a6d5e6640e5",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "任务、执行、配置与写入策略的正式含义，以及只读预检的三权限交集、Runtime 两次预检和三态限制；复核可选查询定义分析仅用已保存快照、源未知仍检查显式目标约束及常量，unsupported 优先于 unknown",
        "en": "Formal task, execution, configuration and apply policy semantics, the precheck permission intersection, two Runtime checks and tri-state limits; reviewed optional query definition analysis from saved snapshots only and explicit target constraints and constants with unknown sources, with unsupported taking precedence over unknown"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "handler",
      "owner": "transfer",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "path": "transfer/backend/internal/api/task_handler.go",
      "anchor": "func validDelegatedTaskCreation(",
      "commit": "a049fc71dd51118f44f53306cea066f0ae3bad97",
      "sha256": "9060c2450965e3c88de769d26fe94c1580ac61ac01c8596738b36aa9719609fa",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "委托创建的有界快照、禁用调度及扫描约束；复核只读预检注释中的纯查询定义分析和源未知时的显式目标约束，创建条件与权限不变",
        "en": "Delegated bounded snapshot creation without scheduling or scanning; reviewed read-only precheck annotations for pure query definition analysis and explicit target constraints with unknown sources, without changing creation conditions or permissions"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "service",
      "owner": "transfer",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "path": "transfer/backend/internal/service/task_service.go",
      "anchor": "Status:       models.TaskStatusIdle,",
      "commit": "6e30cd0d5cbcffb362cdc240ba75aba9401a56d8",
      "sha256": "18cda9a7ac7f84639537157ede432f90e815dc67dd7cc697616ab60c39fb8741",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "持久化任务定义及初始状态，不启动 execution",
        "en": "Persist task definition and initial state without starting execution"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "owner_test",
      "owner": "transfer",
      "kind": "test",
      "path": "transfer/backend/internal/api/delegated_task_test.go",
      "anchor": "func TestDelegatedCreatePersistsStoppedTaskWithoutExecution(",
      "commit": "da04a5acc3678f78cd91866716c3649df1331eff",
      "sha256": "92504370863336a22ff2ab31fd960ba4573c869cc3d43aa306de83e24d043dbb",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "验证创建成功、禁止参数及零 execution",
        "en": "Verify creation, rejected parameters and zero executions"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "manifest",
      "owner": "common-python",
      "kind": "contract",
      "path": "common-python/addp_common/tools/manifest.json",
      "anchor": "\"name\": \"transfer.task.create\"",
      "commit": "5a2c2f8bd114663ae6f5cfaf82d4f61468600264",
      "sha256": "800590c54a504820849d05ffcfdd3e00bbb62c7f3d1437a25e7d49fa4493f197",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "创建与预检共用唯一输入定义；创建 v3 保持标准字段类型及快照 replace/append，不接受 keys；预检声明独立只读 Tool、三项权限交集及受限三态报告",
        "en": "Create and precheck share one input definition; create v3 retains standard field types and snapshot replace/append without keys; precheck declares a separate read-only Tool, three-permission intersection and limited tri-state report"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool_test",
      "owner": "common-python",
      "kind": "test",
      "path": "common-python/tests/test_platform_transfer_tools.py",
      "anchor": "def test_transfer_create_schema_rejects_schedules_credentials_and_other_modes(",
      "commit": "7017af0d4be267731a364316c03b3c39e6f1f13c",
      "sha256": "ca26073079be88c193dfc6f8286611932b1a5fc27ab452c36d2edc5174a12a6c",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "核验 Tool 引用、创建参数和 owner HTTP 契约；标准类型与 Common 一致，非标准类型、快照 upsert 及 keys 在委托前拒绝",
        "en": "Verify Tool references, creation arguments and owner HTTP contract; types match Common; nonstandard types, snapshot upsert and keys fail before delegation"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "skill",
      "owner": "transfer",
      "kind": "procedure",
      "path": "skills/transfer-generation/SKILL.md",
      "anchor": "## 核心流程",
      "commit": "88329610a6685d68f66b40cf42906c4d76e3f014",
      "sha256": "c4a4fb95bf29249d2c3e75334baba4b657b07a97327fa9009ab604cea230c718",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "事实获取、用户澄清、确切配置复核与创建步骤；分别确认行粒度和字段范围，草稿检查不进入创建复核；Runtime 固定报告展示事实，Skill 单点维护默认业务概要及关键解释，用户明确要求时详解，不裁剪完整诊断",
        "en": "Fact discovery, clarification, exact configuration review and creation; separate row grain from retained fields and keep draft checks out of creation review; Runtime displays report facts, while Skill alone owns concise business summaries and key explanations with explicit requested detail, without pruning diagnostics"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "conditions",
      "owner": "agent",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "path": "agent/backend/agents/platform_conditions.py",
      "anchor": "def validate_create(",
      "commit": "00d6da240197047afe41e030c63430c3ee7b37de",
      "sha256": "805fb2a6844536f953489332a1fe7b9b698a1f30718d2888037b5932aa29a7c7",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "Runtime 条件适配与能力修订、参数和结构事实的复核绑定",
        "en": "Runtime condition adapters and review binding to revision, arguments and schema facts"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "condition_test",
      "owner": "agent",
      "kind": "test",
      "path": "agent/backend/tests/test_platform_conditions.py",
      "anchor": "class PlatformConditionTests(",
      "commit": "c1f993b1fa7c5d5e403e463c371c46b2adf4ae80",
      "sha256": "43a88b4252fa79c8fddd70efd3cc8fcec31c91c1bedb5e18c74b88d6633eacb7",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "验证条件拒绝、参数或事实变化后重新确认",
        "en": "Verify condition refusal and re-review after arguments or facts change"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "policy_spec",
      "owner": "transfer",
      "kind": "normative",
      "path": "transfer/docs/transfer-任务语义与同步模式.md",
      "anchor": "## 三、当前支持矩阵",
      "commit": "e098da99a0cdb691b311962aaee6e006b2d0ce3a",
      "sha256": "3ef63fcc860d7a9f9e2fe1ea7bcc73d814b905139c304c7b3f5da5999717d214",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "正式支持矩阵区分快照 replace/append 与增量 upsert，不混用装载和写入方式",
        "en": "Formal matrix distinguishes snapshot replace/append from incremental upsert"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "runtime",
      "owner": "agent",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "path": "agent/backend/graph/factory.py",
      "anchor": "async def _run_config_check(",
      "commit": "88329610a6685d68f66b40cf42906c4d76e3f014",
      "sha256": "6f3304fa3a9b3760e9f7de930a6033bfe9948cfacb06e0517d2108a30056ca82",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "最终复核和创建前经正式 Adapter 自动预检；定义拒绝反馈 owner 诊断供修正且不创建，服务失败清旧报告并终止、不重试；有效检查生成只读投影，不带主体或绑定摘要；Runtime 指明卡片来源，报告后的领域短答引用 Skill，不另设逐项转述指导或声称确定性理解自然语言",
        "en": "Formal Adapter checks before review and creation; rejected definitions return owner diagnostics without creation, while service failures clear stale reports and stop without retry; valid checks produce read-only projections without identities or binding hashes; Runtime declares card provenance and delegates reply guidance to Skill without duplicate enumeration guidance or deterministic intent claims"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "runtime_test",
      "owner": "agent",
      "kind": "test",
      "path": "agent/backend/tests/test_transfer_precheck_runtime.py",
      "anchor": "class TransferPrecheckRuntimeTests(",
      "commit": "88329610a6685d68f66b40cf42906c4d76e3f014",
      "sha256": "b8aa77c50da3a5e7a6a69669dfe742f5bc3a25fb6dec7f8d7783492c39c38549",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "真实 Harness、Manifest、SDK 下验证知情确认、请求绑定、稳定事实变化、拒绝诊断反馈、重新预检、失败与取消无副作用；受控调用加载生产 Skill 组合，三态下短答指导进入模型且完整诊断保留，固定投影和数组字段不丢失；错误不生成卡片，不代替自由模型简洁性验收",
        "en": "Real Harness, Manifest and SDK verify informed confirmation, request binding, stable changes, rejection feedback, fresh checks and zero effects on failure or cancellation; controlled calls load production Skill composition and retain concise guidance and full diagnostics for all states, fixed projections and array fields; errors produce no card and tests do not prove free-model concision"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "planner",
      "owner": "transfer",
      "kind": "implementation",
      "path": "transfer/backend/internal/planner/table_export.go",
      "anchor": "func validateTableTransferSpec(",
      "commit": "69bc839ca0c9f2f94d9661a0904cafd5c2c58b78",
      "sha256": "8656d331fec7cba24592beefe14701ea2f528098c57f410f562e72a7e595af9b",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "Transfer Planner 对快照目标 apply_mode 仅接受 replace/append，拒绝其他组合；已复核 CSV/TSV 的 Meta 编码消费调整，写入模式约束不变",
        "en": "Transfer Planner admits only replace/append as snapshot target apply modes; reviewed CSV/TSV consumption of Meta encoding facts without changing apply mode constraints"
      }
    }
  ],
